  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: Salesians of Don Bosco Ireland PROJECT: The Salesian will work at enhancing the livelihood opportunities and household income of rural and disadvantaged women through training and capacity-building programmes, focusing on group management, financial literacy, and leadership skills to pursue entrepreneurship. transformative change in the lives of children, youth, and women from selected marginalised and excluded tribal communities through initiatives including legal aid, livelihood support, education, addressing nutritional deficiencies, improving overall wellbeing.</narrative>
